WEBVTT

00:00:02.670 --> 00:00:03.600
<i>Tadokoro-san...</i>

00:00:03.950 --> 00:00:06.860
<i>I made it to the Inter-High.</i>

00:00:07.180 --> 00:00:09.780
<i>And the green number tag goal line.</i>

00:00:09.780 --> 00:00:11.150
<i>There's one kilometer left.</i>

00:00:11.150 --> 00:00:13.990
<i>I'll believe in myself and 
pedal as hard as I can.</i>

00:00:14.680 --> 00:00:16.970
<i>Kaburagi is a hard worker.</i>

00:00:16.970 --> 00:00:17.990
<i>If we get this...</i>

00:00:18.810 --> 00:00:20.890
<i>I'll shower him with praise.</i>

00:00:24.010 --> 00:00:28.670
<i>After all, I'm in this position 
because of his hard work.</i>

00:00:30.620 --> 00:00:32.170
<i>I'll introduce him to you sometime.</i>

00:00:33.180 --> 00:00:35.510
<i>Kaburagi Issa hasn't realized it himself yet,</i>

00:00:35.950 --> 00:00:40.390
<i>but he's the next generation of sprinter 
who will carry Sohoku High School.</i>

00:00:41.100 --> 00:00:42.850
<i>He's a little stupid, though.</i>

00:00:44.450 --> 00:00:48.310
<i>You'd probably say that's 
what's good about him.</i>

00:00:49.270 --> 00:00:52.320
<i>But first, I'll definitely...</i>

00:00:52.840 --> 00:00:54.900
<i>Take the first result!</i>

00:00:55.330 --> 00:00:57.530
<i>That's my job!</i>

00:00:58.230 --> 00:00:59.030
<i>My legs will make it.</i>

00:01:00.300 --> 00:01:01.940
<i>You just wait, Junta.</i>

00:01:01.940 --> 00:01:04.120
<i>I'll bring back the green number—</i>

00:01:07.260 --> 00:01:08.620
Run.

00:01:09.850 --> 00:01:12.500
Hey, run faster!

00:01:14.300 --> 00:01:18.000
This jersey is too small.

00:01:18.580 --> 00:01:20.330
It's in the way.

00:01:20.330 --> 00:01:23.020
Come on, run. I'll...

00:01:23.020 --> 00:01:26.770
...crush you and your bike underfoot!

00:01:28.340 --> 00:01:30.110
I broke it again!

00:01:30.520 --> 00:01:32.980
The zippers on these jerseys are so weak!

00:01:54.630 --> 00:01:57.130
<b><i>Yowamushi Pedal</i></b>

00:03:07.760 --> 00:03:12.270
<i>RIDE.20  Full Throttle, Kaburagi!</i>

00:03:13.220 --> 00:03:15.190
Uh, Teshima-san.

00:03:15.190 --> 00:03:18.180
It's been a while since Aoyagi-san 
and Kaburagi-kun left.

00:03:18.180 --> 00:03:21.260
Do you think they've caught up to the front?

00:03:21.730 --> 00:03:23.930
Are you worried, Onoda?

00:03:23.930 --> 00:03:27.970
If everything's gone well,
they should be getting there soon.

00:03:27.970 --> 00:03:32.060
The leaders should be reaching 
the first result line around now.

00:03:34.040 --> 00:03:36.230
It'll be decided soon...

00:03:36.230 --> 00:03:39.310
Who's the fastest sprinter of this race.

00:03:39.310 --> 00:03:41.000
Seven hundred meters left!

00:03:42.070 --> 00:03:43.860
Flee! Flee!

00:03:44.960 --> 00:03:46.950
Interesting, interesting...

00:03:48.270 --> 00:03:51.850
Nothing beats chasing someone down!

00:03:53.960 --> 00:03:56.200
<i>He's faster than I expected.</i>

00:03:56.200 --> 00:03:57.920
<i>He's pushing me from behind.</i>

00:03:57.920 --> 00:04:00.760
<i>He could pass me at any time.</i>

00:04:00.760 --> 00:04:02.410
<i>Damn it. What should I do?</i>

00:04:02.410 --> 00:04:03.930
<i>There's 650 meters left.</i>

00:04:04.490 --> 00:04:05.940
<i>Should I change my course?</i>

00:04:05.940 --> 00:04:09.310
<i>No, at this pace, he'd pass me.</i>

00:04:09.310 --> 00:04:11.500
<i>What should you do, Aoyagi Hajime?</i>

00:04:14.230 --> 00:04:15.530
<i>I don't have a choice.</i>

00:04:15.530 --> 00:04:20.550
<i>I wanted to save this for the final 150 
meter sprint before the finish line.</i>

00:04:26.060 --> 00:04:28.590
Ultimate Aoyagi Technique!

00:04:28.590 --> 00:04:31.370
Human Bullet Bambi Style!

00:04:31.370 --> 00:04:34.250
What? He transformed again!

00:04:37.000 --> 00:04:38.420
Sohoku High School's accelerating!

00:04:38.420 --> 00:04:39.750
He's so fast!

00:04:39.750 --> 00:04:41.540
What's up with his legs? Are those logs?

00:04:41.540 --> 00:04:44.880
He was already round,
but he transformed again!

00:04:46.970 --> 00:04:50.140
He pulled farther ahead out of the corner!

00:04:50.140 --> 00:04:52.450
Sohoku High School's #4 is amazing!

00:04:53.270 --> 00:04:55.890
<i>Human Bullet Bambi Style...</i>

00:04:56.590 --> 00:04:59.650
<i>I release the muscles in my 
torso that I'd been focusing on</i>

00:04:59.650 --> 00:05:01.030
<i>and focus on my legs instead.</i>

00:05:01.800 --> 00:05:06.390
<i>I can't keep it up for long, but it 
doubles my explosive sprinting ability.</i>

00:05:06.450 --> 00:05:09.950
<b>Minegayama</b>

00:05:07.790 --> 00:05:11.700
You know how you'd run from 
me when we played tag?

00:05:12.250 --> 00:05:15.390
I wonder if you could make it stronger.

00:05:15.950 --> 00:05:16.710
Stronger?

00:05:17.100 --> 00:05:20.750
I have a feeling it has more potential.

00:05:21.170 --> 00:05:23.640
You might be able to use it 
at the next Inter-High.

00:05:25.110 --> 00:05:26.900
<i>Strengthening my running...</i>

00:05:31.870 --> 00:05:34.360
Aoyagi-san's Human Bullet is insane.

00:05:34.360 --> 00:05:35.770
He's going super fast.

00:05:35.770 --> 00:05:37.520
His pulling is amazing.

00:05:37.870 --> 00:05:38.800
They're right.

00:05:38.800 --> 00:05:41.430
I'm pulling, not running.

00:05:41.430 --> 00:05:44.410
Running requires stronger acceleration.

00:05:45.650 --> 00:05:46.650
Which means...

00:05:47.930 --> 00:05:49.760
<i>That's how these legs were born.</i>

00:05:49.760 --> 00:05:51.740
<i>That became this, Bambi Style.</i>

00:05:52.200 --> 00:05:54.650
<i>If surviving makes you the strongest,</i>

00:05:54.650 --> 00:05:58.380
<i>then the strongest animals on Earth 
are the always-fleeing herbivores.</i>

00:05:58.380 --> 00:06:01.210
<i>These are legs of certain escape!</i>

00:06:04.170 --> 00:06:07.130
<i>I'll pull ahead of him and 
run to the result line.</i>

00:06:07.130 --> 00:06:09.330
<i>Then nobody can beat me!</i>

00:06:10.260 --> 00:06:13.180
<i>I'll win! You just watch, Junta!</i>

00:06:13.890 --> 00:06:17.180
<i>You're always saving me with your ideas!</i>

00:06:19.620 --> 00:06:21.440
<i>It won't last long.</i>

00:06:22.620 --> 00:06:24.070
<i>I'll make it last!</i>

00:06:24.070 --> 00:06:27.570
<i>It's my turn to return the favor, Junta!</i>

00:06:30.740 --> 00:06:34.600
Do you know how much Hakone Academy 
High School trains every day?

00:06:35.090 --> 00:06:39.460
Do you know how unforgiving the 
member selection tournament is?

00:06:39.990 --> 00:06:42.920
You're trying to run from me, aren't you?

00:06:43.430 --> 00:06:44.380
<i>Doubashi!</i>

00:06:44.930 --> 00:06:46.300
<i>He's right behind me.</i>

00:06:46.760 --> 00:06:53.300
Sorry, but prey that's fleeing 
as fast as it can is my favorite!

00:06:55.860 --> 00:07:00.370
T-Teshima-san, do you 
think Aoyagi-san will win?

00:07:00.370 --> 00:07:01.140
Huh?

00:07:01.140 --> 00:07:02.680
Oh, I just...

00:07:02.680 --> 00:07:07.570
Hakone Academy High School's #15 was 
big and seemed strong, so I thought...

00:07:08.010 --> 00:07:09.860
You mean Doubashi?

00:07:09.860 --> 00:07:13.070
He's in your grade. He's a second-year.

00:07:13.070 --> 00:07:14.700
What?!

00:07:15.150 --> 00:07:19.140
If size were the determining factor,
then Aoyagi would lose.

00:07:19.140 --> 00:07:22.290
But that's not what road racing is about.

00:07:22.710 --> 00:07:27.590
It's a combination of willpower, 
conditions, teamwork, and strategy.

00:07:28.100 --> 00:07:31.660
You use everything you can 
to find an opportunity.

00:07:32.420 --> 00:07:36.180
You work together, strategize, 
look out for your teammates,

00:07:36.180 --> 00:07:39.680
give everything you've got, and throw 
your wheels across the finish line.

00:07:40.440 --> 00:07:42.310
I'm betting on Aoyagi.

00:07:45.500 --> 00:07:49.750
Believe in the strength of 
Aoyagi and Kaburagi, Onoda.

00:07:50.180 --> 00:07:52.860
Remember what he said? 
It's not the two of them.

00:07:55.100 --> 00:07:56.570
The six of us together are a team.

00:07:59.700 --> 00:08:02.460
Run faster, little Bambi!

00:08:06.730 --> 00:08:08.450
<i>I won't last much longer.</i>

00:08:08.450 --> 00:08:09.370
<i>Damn it.</i>

00:08:11.310 --> 00:08:13.740
It's right there. This'll be easy.

00:08:14.800 --> 00:08:17.220
Thanks for the meal, Bambi!

00:08:17.620 --> 00:08:21.230
Whatever you do, don't lose 
to Sohoku High School!

00:08:21.680 --> 00:08:25.440
<i>Izumida-san, they gave me some trouble.</i>

00:08:25.950 --> 00:08:27.940
But they were nothing special!

00:08:29.490 --> 00:08:31.820
Move, Sohoku High School! It's over!

00:08:32.900 --> 00:08:35.910
There's 400 meters left! 
They're finally neck and neck!

00:08:35.910 --> 00:08:37.620
All three of them!

00:08:38.700 --> 00:08:39.700
Three?

00:08:40.160 --> 00:08:41.530
Aoyagi-san!

00:08:41.530 --> 00:08:46.370
I got a really bad feeling 
about this, so I followed him!

00:08:49.830 --> 00:08:55.710
We have two cards up our sleeve,
so we'll make full use of both of them.

00:08:55.710 --> 00:08:57.760
That's Sohoku High School's style,

00:08:58.290 --> 00:08:59.410
Hakone Academy High School!

00:09:00.510 --> 00:09:03.230
What are you doing here, orange?

00:09:03.230 --> 00:09:07.060
<i>Was he sticking behind me? No...</i>

00:09:07.310 --> 00:09:09.940
<i>But I turned around to check numerous times.</i>

00:09:09.940 --> 00:09:12.820
<i>I know I didn't see him.</i>

00:09:13.170 --> 00:09:19.320
<i>Was he hiding in the blind 
spot created by my jersey?</i>

00:09:19.320 --> 00:09:20.730
Orange!

00:09:20.730 --> 00:09:21.830
Pig!

00:09:22.840 --> 00:09:24.200
<i>It was one in ten thousand.</i>

00:09:25.740 --> 00:09:30.490
<i>I only told Kaburagi to pull for me 
so I could go all out at the end.</i>

00:09:31.130 --> 00:09:37.430
<i>But he sensed the danger in a moment 
and reflexively pursued Doubashi.</i>

00:09:39.690 --> 00:09:41.650
<i>I can't believe he caught up.</i>

00:09:41.650 --> 00:09:45.820
<i>I only imagined there might be a one in ten 
thousand chance that this might happen.</i>

00:09:46.260 --> 00:09:47.940
<i>He's an idiot...</i>

00:09:47.940 --> 00:09:50.060
<i>But he's perceptive.</i>

00:09:50.600 --> 00:09:51.440
Aoyagi-san!

00:09:54.820 --> 00:09:56.070
Get behind me!

00:09:56.690 --> 00:09:57.910
I'll pull for you again.

00:09:57.910 --> 00:09:58.820
I'll launch you.

00:09:58.820 --> 00:10:00.280
I need you to sprint.

00:10:00.750 --> 00:10:03.540
Let me handle this pig, Aoyagi-san!

00:10:03.900 --> 00:10:05.660
Three hundred and fifty meters left!

00:10:06.820 --> 00:10:08.230
Don't get ahead of yourselves.

00:10:08.230 --> 00:10:10.630
Increasing your numbers from one 
to two won't change anything.

00:10:11.240 --> 00:10:15.130
I'll pass you, too, orange!

00:10:15.130 --> 00:10:20.760
A sprinter like Aoyagi-san won't have 
any trouble with a sub like you, pig!

00:10:20.760 --> 00:10:22.300
There's a light shining...

00:10:23.700 --> 00:10:25.250
On Sohoku High School.

00:10:25.250 --> 00:10:28.190
If I used my Bambi Style, I thought...

00:10:28.190 --> 00:10:30.150
What? Where's the light?

00:10:30.620 --> 00:10:32.640
I thought I could pull ahead of Doubashi.

00:10:32.640 --> 00:10:35.110
I thought I'd make it to the result line.

00:10:35.620 --> 00:10:38.730
But he's stronger than I thought.

00:10:38.730 --> 00:10:42.710
He stopped my legs of certain 
escape and caught up.

00:10:43.450 --> 00:10:46.330
I thought I might not be able to win.

00:10:48.640 --> 00:10:50.540
You should take the sprint.

00:10:51.420 --> 00:10:54.130
You're the light, Kaburagi.

00:10:54.760 --> 00:10:56.840
You can do it.

00:10:57.170 --> 00:10:58.180
I can't!

00:10:58.180 --> 00:11:00.340
I'm an all-rounder!

00:11:00.340 --> 00:11:02.840
<i>What? He's still saying that?</i>

00:11:03.530 --> 00:11:05.110
<i>I take back what I said.</i>

00:11:05.110 --> 00:11:07.600
<i>He's totally imperceptive.</i>

00:11:07.600 --> 00:11:08.430
Do it!

00:11:08.430 --> 00:11:09.230
I can't!

00:11:09.230 --> 00:11:10.000
Take it!

00:11:10.000 --> 00:11:10.980
I can't!

00:11:11.380 --> 00:11:12.850
The pig is accelerating.

00:11:12.850 --> 00:11:14.230
He's entering a sprinting form.

00:11:14.650 --> 00:11:16.020
<i>He'll pull ahead.</i>

00:11:17.150 --> 00:11:20.150
<i>Give the last bit of 
strength you have, Hajime!</i>

00:11:21.700 --> 00:11:24.370
Why are you jumping ahead, Aoyagi-san?

00:11:24.370 --> 00:11:25.900
I'm blocking the wind!

00:11:25.900 --> 00:11:29.000
Why would you spend your strength 
for the result line now?

00:11:29.350 --> 00:11:32.610
<i>Idiot. I've already exhausted my Bambi Style.</i>

00:11:32.610 --> 00:11:35.880
<i>I don't have the strength left to sprint.</i>

00:11:36.840 --> 00:11:38.170
When I give the signal, go!

00:11:38.170 --> 00:11:39.600
I'm not going!

00:11:39.600 --> 00:11:41.710
I thought you believed in God!

00:11:41.710 --> 00:11:44.850
What? I do, but so what?

00:11:44.850 --> 00:11:47.490
Where's God right now?

00:11:47.490 --> 00:11:48.810
There are no vending machines around.

00:11:55.700 --> 00:11:59.400
G-God's notepad...

00:12:00.530 --> 00:12:03.440
<i>I can't believe I had this in my pocket.</i>

00:12:05.080 --> 00:12:09.410
You should imagine all possible scenarios 
and think of how to deal with them.

00:12:09.410 --> 00:12:11.830
Hakone Academy High School's 
Doubashi is strong.

00:12:11.830 --> 00:12:15.360
You should simulate how 
you can use Kaburagi, too.

00:12:17.820 --> 00:12:19.430
What are you writing?

00:12:19.430 --> 00:12:20.920
A magical note.

00:12:21.640 --> 00:12:24.490
<i>I said it was one in ten thousand,</i>

00:12:24.490 --> 00:12:30.680
<i>but maybe some part of me believed
that he would follow me this far.</i>

00:12:31.470 --> 00:12:32.850
This is...

00:12:36.510 --> 00:12:37.770
Aoyagi-san.

00:12:37.770 --> 00:12:39.120
Take it!

00:12:39.120 --> 00:12:41.530
It's God's final note for you!

00:12:42.610 --> 00:12:45.450
<b>Sprint as hard
as you can for
 the result line</b>

00:12:43.400 --> 00:12:45.450
"Sprint as hard as you 
can for the result line!"

00:12:49.950 --> 00:12:51.040
Yes, sir!

00:12:51.610 --> 00:12:53.330
<i>His pressure skyrocketed.</i>

00:12:54.440 --> 00:12:58.420
<i>I've never seen such a pure...</i>

00:12:58.860 --> 00:13:00.060
<i>Sprint!</i>

00:13:08.180 --> 00:13:11.720
<i>I've won countless sprints before now.</i>

00:13:11.720 --> 00:13:14.810
<i>I've crushed sprinters 
that others called strong.</i>

00:13:15.210 --> 00:13:21.180
<i>That's why I can feel who's a real sprinter, 
who's going for the result line...</i>

00:13:21.180 --> 00:13:23.780
<i>And how fast a sprinter someone is.</i>

00:13:24.850 --> 00:13:29.950
<i>But I didn't even notice until now 
that this orange is a sprinter.</i>

00:13:30.540 --> 00:13:33.910
I understand, God. I'll do it.

00:13:33.910 --> 00:13:36.560
I'll use everything you taught me...

00:13:37.010 --> 00:13:39.080
...to win this sprint!

00:13:41.530 --> 00:13:44.510
<i>It skyrocketed. What's going
on with his pressure?</i>

00:13:45.070 --> 00:13:48.130
<i>He was acting as the third-year 
Aoyagi's assistant until now.</i>

00:13:48.130 --> 00:13:49.980
<i>But he's changed completely.</i>

00:13:49.980 --> 00:13:52.260
<i>That's the face of a 
sprinter aiming for first.</i>

00:13:52.880 --> 00:13:56.180
<i>Only those riding on the 
course could feel the tension</i>

00:13:56.180 --> 00:13:59.270
<i>flowing through the air right now.</i>

00:14:01.780 --> 00:14:07.360
<i>That moment when an arrow is loosed towards 
its target and time seems to stand still.</i>

00:14:07.770 --> 00:14:09.360
<i>This tense moment of silence.</i>

00:14:14.250 --> 00:14:17.830
<i>The final sprint is starting!</i>

00:14:25.460 --> 00:14:27.630
Go, Kaburagi!

00:14:28.370 --> 00:14:29.930
Yes, sir!

00:14:39.560 --> 00:14:41.060
They're neck and neck!

00:14:41.060 --> 00:14:42.860
Two hundred meters left!

00:14:46.280 --> 00:14:48.070
Sohoku High School's resting!

00:14:48.070 --> 00:14:50.490
<i>What is he doing? Does he 
have strength to spare?</i>

00:14:57.820 --> 00:14:58.870
He's accelerating!

00:15:03.260 --> 00:15:07.570
<i>He took a moment to rest behind 
me before accelerating again.</i>

00:15:08.220 --> 00:15:09.790
<i>Two-stage acceleration...</i>

00:15:09.790 --> 00:15:11.930
<i>I can't predict his movements.</i>

00:15:12.270 --> 00:15:13.980
<i>What's his next move?</i>

00:15:13.980 --> 00:15:18.020
<i>Is he a genius, or just an idiot?</i>

00:15:18.560 --> 00:15:21.900
<i>But this situation itself 
is advantageous to me.</i>

00:15:21.900 --> 00:15:23.900
<i>I can ride behind him.</i>

00:15:23.900 --> 00:15:26.060
<i>What will he do? He's not moving.</i>

00:15:26.060 --> 00:15:27.570
<i>Is he not thinking?</i>

00:15:27.570 --> 00:15:30.610
<i>He's a mysterious sprinter...</i>

00:15:31.300 --> 00:15:32.240
But he's an idiot!

00:15:33.740 --> 00:15:36.120
Hakone Academy High School's 
sticking right behind him!

00:15:36.120 --> 00:15:38.200
He's saving his strength 
by hiding from the wind!

00:15:38.740 --> 00:15:42.190
I'll show you my monster sprint!

00:15:42.190 --> 00:15:43.500
I don't lose!

00:15:43.500 --> 00:15:45.790
I'm Hakone Academy High School!

00:15:45.790 --> 00:15:49.260
This year's fastest sprinter 
is about to be decided!

00:15:49.260 --> 00:15:51.340
One hundred meters left!

00:15:51.730 --> 00:15:54.590
Go in, go in, go in, go in...

00:15:54.590 --> 00:15:56.560
<i>What? "Go in"?</i>

00:15:56.560 --> 00:15:57.380
<i>Is it his gears?</i>

00:15:57.380 --> 00:16:00.270
<i>Is he having trouble switching into top gear?</i>

00:16:02.170 --> 00:16:03.940
<i>How unfortunate for him.</i>

00:16:03.940 --> 00:16:06.560
<i>No wonder his acceleration was lacking.</i>

00:16:06.560 --> 00:16:11.190
<i>Orange, I wish I could've raced you 
when you weren't having bike trouble.</i>

00:16:13.610 --> 00:16:16.240
Doubashi's making his move!
 He's jumping ahead!

00:16:16.710 --> 00:16:17.780
Go in!

00:16:19.670 --> 00:16:20.260
What?

00:16:20.260 --> 00:16:23.310
What do I think about before the finish line?

00:16:23.900 --> 00:16:25.710
Big gears.

00:16:25.710 --> 00:16:26.600
What?

00:16:27.120 --> 00:16:28.630
I imagine gears.

00:16:29.200 --> 00:16:33.630
Strangely enough, when they fit together, 
it makes me feel really strong.

00:16:34.060 --> 00:16:35.050
Go in.

00:16:36.550 --> 00:16:39.480
Go in!

00:16:39.480 --> 00:16:40.180
It's in!

00:16:41.090 --> 00:16:42.180
<i>All right!</i>

00:16:42.180 --> 00:16:43.690
<i>Go, Kaburagi!</i>

00:16:44.040 --> 00:16:45.400
<i>It's not bike trouble?</i>

00:16:52.800 --> 00:16:55.240
<i>There's 80 meters to the first result line.</i>

00:16:55.240 --> 00:16:55.990
<i>I...</i>

00:16:55.990 --> 00:16:57.030
<i>I...</i>

00:16:57.030 --> 00:16:58.740
<i>I'll win!</i>

00:16:59.050 --> 00:17:00.290
Pig!

00:17:00.610 --> 00:17:01.410
<i>I got this!</i>

00:17:01.410 --> 00:17:02.830
Orange!

00:17:03.160 --> 00:17:04.290
<i>He's coming!</i>

00:17:04.290 --> 00:17:05.870
Sprint!

00:17:05.870 --> 00:17:07.130
They're both accelerating!

00:17:11.460 --> 00:17:13.290
I'll win!

00:17:13.290 --> 00:17:14.920
Fifty meters left!

00:17:14.920 --> 00:17:17.690
<i>Too limited. They're too limited.</i>

00:17:17.690 --> 00:17:20.360
<i>The world's rules are too limited.</i>

00:17:20.360 --> 00:17:21.510
<i>Line up.</i>

00:17:21.510 --> 00:17:22.710
<i>Don't move.</i>

00:17:22.710 --> 00:17:24.430
<i>Don't talk back.</i>

00:17:24.430 --> 00:17:26.600
<i>I've always been a big guy.</i>

00:17:26.600 --> 00:17:28.770
<i>That's why I stick out.</i>

00:17:29.150 --> 00:17:30.820
<i>But what's wrong with that?</i>

00:17:30.820 --> 00:17:32.280
<i>I'm right.</i>

00:17:32.760 --> 00:17:35.500
<i>But for a while, I was unsure.</i>

00:17:35.980 --> 00:17:39.450
<i>I tried to fit within the 
limited rules of society.</i>

00:17:39.450 --> 00:17:45.330
<i>That's when Izumida-san told me to stick out.</i>

00:17:45.850 --> 00:17:49.000
<i>He said I could ride the way I wanted.</i>

00:17:49.340 --> 00:17:52.550
<i>He told me to take the first result!</i>

00:17:52.550 --> 00:17:57.200
<i>How could I not give everything 
I've got to win it?</i>

00:17:57.200 --> 00:17:59.720
<i>The first result line is mine!</i>

00:17:59.720 --> 00:18:04.310
<i>I'm bringing it home to
Hakone Academy High School, Izumida-san!</i>

00:18:06.810 --> 00:18:09.170
<i>Seriously? What is this 
that's flowing out of me?</i>

00:18:09.170 --> 00:18:10.310
<i>It's so fast.</i>

00:18:10.310 --> 00:18:12.080
<i>It's super fast.</i>

00:18:12.080 --> 00:18:14.320
<i>My heart hurts, but I can't stop.</i>

00:18:14.670 --> 00:18:17.560
<i>It's like all the gears in 
my body are locked together.</i>

00:18:17.560 --> 00:18:19.140
<i>From the top of my head 
to the tips of my toes,</i>

00:18:19.140 --> 00:18:21.840
<i>they're all connected and 
moving forward as one.</i>

00:18:21.840 --> 00:18:24.350
<i>Am I excited by this sprint?</i>

00:18:24.350 --> 00:18:27.500
<i>My body's telling me to pass 
the guy in front of me.</i>

00:18:28.710 --> 00:18:31.040
<i>All the blood in my body is boiling!</i>

00:18:31.440 --> 00:18:32.960
Thirty meters left!

00:18:32.960 --> 00:18:35.500
Win, win, win!

00:18:35.500 --> 00:18:38.970
I'll win!

00:18:38.970 --> 00:18:40.550
<i>It's boiling.</i>

00:18:40.860 --> 00:18:42.460
<i>Go, Kaburagi.</i>

00:18:42.460 --> 00:18:44.390
<i>You can do it!</i>

00:18:48.610 --> 00:18:49.950
They're neck and neck again!

00:18:49.950 --> 00:18:51.560
It's the final sprint!

00:18:52.000 --> 00:18:58.290
I thought Doubashi looked like he would 
play dirty, but he's an honorable racer.

00:18:58.290 --> 00:19:01.570
I've seen most of his races.

00:19:01.570 --> 00:19:06.230
He talks a big game and has a huge attitude, 
but he always fights head-to-head.

00:19:06.230 --> 00:19:08.200
He always plays fair.

00:19:09.030 --> 00:19:11.160
That's why he has so many fans!

00:19:11.160 --> 00:19:12.210
Doubashi!

00:19:12.210 --> 00:19:14.590
Go, Hakone Academy High School's Doubashi!

00:19:14.960 --> 00:19:16.770
Doubashi-senpai, you can do it!

00:19:16.770 --> 00:19:18.840
Pedal harder, Senpai!

00:19:19.260 --> 00:19:21.380
<i>I know.</i>

00:19:21.650 --> 00:19:24.390
<i>I finally made it to the Inter-High.</i>

00:19:24.640 --> 00:19:30.350
<i>If I don't win this, all the races I 
won since this spring are worthless.</i>

00:19:32.690 --> 00:19:35.040
<i>The pig's a few centimeters ahead.</i>

00:19:35.040 --> 00:19:35.690
<i>Damn it!</i>

00:19:36.310 --> 00:19:38.070
<i>The line's right in front 
of me. I can see it.</i>

00:19:38.770 --> 00:19:40.270
<i>My muscles are about to shatter.</i>

00:19:40.270 --> 00:19:44.410
<i>But I know I have to overcome this trial.</i>

00:19:46.150 --> 00:19:47.330
<i>Right, God?</i>

00:19:48.440 --> 00:19:51.680
<i>Why did Aoyagi-san's face pop into my head?</i>

00:19:51.680 --> 00:19:54.790
<i>I don't know. It doesn't matter.</i>

00:19:54.920 --> 00:19:56.790
<i>It's the final push!</i>

00:19:58.300 --> 00:20:00.670
<i>Boil, damn it!</i>

00:20:11.770 --> 00:20:14.180
The first result has been decided!

00:20:14.180 --> 00:20:16.010
Hakone Academy High School's Doubashi wins!

00:20:16.010 --> 00:20:18.270
Sohoku High School caught up at the end!

00:20:18.270 --> 00:20:20.590
Hakone Academy High School stayed ahead!

00:20:20.590 --> 00:20:21.610
It was Sohoku High School!

00:20:27.500 --> 00:20:30.290
You idiot, you didn't win.

00:20:30.290 --> 00:20:33.030
Fool. You didn't notice?

00:20:33.030 --> 00:20:36.210
I got you in the end.

00:20:36.600 --> 00:20:39.550
No, you didn't. That was me.

00:20:39.550 --> 00:20:40.780
It was me.

00:20:40.780 --> 00:20:42.220
It wasn't you.

00:20:42.220 --> 00:20:45.190
I'd never lose to a sub like you.

00:20:45.190 --> 00:20:46.640
I'm a regular, you idiot.

00:20:46.640 --> 00:20:50.190
They're arguing. Who won just now?

00:20:50.190 --> 00:20:51.530
Wasn't it Hakone Academy High School?

00:20:51.530 --> 00:20:53.640
It looked like Sohoku High School to me.

00:20:55.890 --> 00:20:59.070
<i>We have an announcement 
concerning the recent results.</i>

00:21:14.090 --> 00:21:16.830
<i>Though it was a very close race...</i>

00:21:16.830 --> 00:21:17.450
<i>Kaburagi...</i>

00:21:17.450 --> 00:21:20.630
<i>After an evaluation of 
the sensors and photo...</i>

00:21:19.500 --> 00:21:20.630
<i>Good job.</i>

00:21:20.630 --> 00:21:24.880
<i>The winner of the first result 
and green number tag is...</i>

00:21:25.540 --> 00:21:26.400
Issa...

00:21:30.030 --> 00:21:31.260
<b>| 1 | Doubashi Masakiyo | 15 | Kanagawa | Hakone Academy High School |
| 2 | Kaburagi Issa | 6 | Chiba | Sohoku High School |</b>

00:21:33.430 --> 00:21:36.690
<i>Hakone Academy High School's 
Doubashi Masakiyo.</i>

00:23:24.660 --> 00:23:28.090
You're always working hard, Kaburagi-kun.

00:23:28.090 --> 00:23:29.340
It's me.

00:23:29.340 --> 00:23:33.320
<b>Silence</b>

00:23:34.550 --> 00:23:35.450
Maybe not.

00:23:36.160 --> 00:23:39.850
<i>NEXT RIDE  Hakone Academy High School Makes Its Move!</i>

